{"seq":3,"slug":"composable-orchestration-integration-patterns","title":"可组合编排与集成模式：编排 vs 协同、事件驱动中间件与跨服务失败隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/headless-composable-commerce-api-platform/composable-architecture-pattern/composable-orchestration-integration-patterns","wordCount":2969,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"可组合编排与集成模式-编排-vs-协同-事件驱动中间件与跨服务失败隔离\">可组合编排与集成模式：编排 vs 协同、事件驱动中间件与跨服务失败隔离</h1><p>一笔跨境电商订单落地时，会同时触碰库存、支付、风控、税费、履约、通知六七个互相自治的服务。在无头/可组合架构里，这些服务往往来自不同厂商：commercetools 管商品与购物车（docs.commercetools.com），Adyen 收单，Avalara 算税，OMS 管履约，Shopify 的 Storefront API 负责前台读（shopify.dev）。&quot;下单&quot;不再是函数调用，而是一段跨越多个自治域、随时可能中途失败的分布式流程。MACH 联盟（Microservices、API-first、Cloud-native SaaS、Headless，machalliance.org）把这套选型自由度定义为可组合架构的核心价值，但代价是<strong>谁决定调用顺序，以及失败了谁来收拾</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-控制流归属决定了集成形态\">核心概念：控制流归属决定了集成形态</h2><p>编排（orchestration）与协同（choreography）的区别，不在于&quot;用不用消息&quot;，而在于<strong>流程知识放在哪里</strong>。编排由一个中心编排器持有完整流程定义、按序调用各服务，服务被动响应、不知道自己在整体流程中的位置；协同没有中心，每个服务只订阅自己关心的事件、收到后自行决定下一步，流程是涌现出来的。两者的耦合方向相反：编排把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个参与方的依赖收敛到一处，协同则把它摊到参与方之间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph ORCH[编排]&#10;        O[编排器&lt;br/&gt;持有流程定义] --&gt;|命令| S1[库存服务]&#10;        O --&gt;|命令| S2[支付服务]&#10;        O --&gt;|命令| S3[税务服务]&#10;        S1 --&gt;|结果| O&#10;        S2 --&gt;|结果| O&#10;        S3 --&gt;|结果| O&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CHOR[协同]&#10;        E1[订单已创建] --&gt; C1[库存服务]&#10;        E1 --&gt; C2[支付服务]&#10;        C1 --&gt;|库存已预留| E2[事件总线]&#10;        C2 --&gt;|支付已授权| E2&#10;        E2 --&gt; C3[履约服务]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph ORCH[编排]\n        O[编排器&lt;br/&gt;持有流程定义] --&gt;|命令| S1[库存服务]\n        O --&gt;|命令| S2[支付服务]\n        O --&gt;|命令| S3[税务服务]\n        S1 --&gt;|结果| O\n        S2 --&gt;|结果| O\n        S3 --&gt;|结果| O\n    end\n    subgraph CHOR[协同]\n        E1[订单已创建] --&gt; C1[库存服务]\n        E1 --&gt; C2[支付服务]\n        C1 --&gt;|库存已预留| E2[事件总线]\n        C2 --&gt;|支付已授权| E2\n        E2 --&gt; C3[履约服务]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>编排 Orchestration</th>\n<th>协同 Choreography</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流程知识位置</td>\n<td>中心编排器独占</td>\n<td>分散在各参与方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参与方耦合</td>\n<td>与编排器耦合，彼此不耦合</td>\n<td>通过事件契约间接耦合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接数增长</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（编排器 ↔ 各服务）</td>\n<td>最坏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（服务间事件依赖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加一步流程</td>\n<td>改编排器一处</td>\n<td>需某服务新增订阅与发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型失败</td>\n<td>编排器成为单点与瓶颈</td>\n<td>循环事件、难定位的挂起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>有明确顺序与补偿的流程</td>\n<td>广播式通知、多消费者扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>决定性的约束是<strong>可用性串联</strong>。可组合架构把一条下单链路拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立服务，若每个服务的月度可用性为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，链路整体可用性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>flow</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{flow}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">flow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。8 个各自 99.9% 的服务串联，整体只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.999</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>99.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.999^8 \\approx 99.2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.2%</span></span></span></span></span>，一年约 68 小时不可用。这不是架构缺陷，而是可组合的固有税率：买到的解耦与选型自由，代价是可靠性的乘法衰减。后面所有模式——补偿、重试、隔离——都是在把这条乘法链条中的危险段尽可能换回加法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排器的三种实现载体-状态机-bpmn-引擎与持久执行\">编排器的三种实现载体：状态机、BPMN 引擎与持久执行</h2><p>确定用编排后，下一个决策是<strong>编排逻辑写在哪里</strong>。三种载体分野清晰，选择依据是流程复杂度与团队语言偏好。</p>\n<p><strong>托管状态机</strong>以 AWS Step Functions 为代表：流程用 JSON 状态机描述，编排器由云厂商运维，天然带重试、并行、等待与错误分支；边界是复杂条件分支冗长，且强绑定单一云。<strong>BPMN 工作流引擎</strong>（Camunda / Zeebe）面向业务可读的流程图，适合流程需频繁被非工程角色审阅的场景，代价是引入一套引擎与建模语言作为长期资产。<strong>代码优先的持久执行</strong>（durable execution，代表是 Temporal，temporal.io）把编排写成普通代码，运行时自动持久化每一步状态，进程崩溃后从断点恢复；代价是依赖一个高可用的持久化执行集群。</p>\n<p>三者共享同一个底层语义：<strong>Saga</strong>。该模式由 Garcia-Molina 与 Salem 在 1987 年 SIGMOD 论文提出，核心是把一个长事务拆成一系列本地事务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1, \\dots, T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 配一个补偿动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 失败，则逆序执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{k-1}, \\dots, C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。它与两阶段提交（2PC）的关键差异是<strong>放弃原子性换取可用性</strong>：2PC 在协调者故障时会阻塞并持有锁，Saga 任何时候都不长期持有跨服务锁，代价是中间态对外可见，且必须接受&quot;补偿不是回滚&quot;——退款不是&quot;撤销扣款&quot;，而是一笔新交易。</p>\n<p>因此可补偿性是设计约束：发送短信、发出物流指令、向海关申报这类副作用无法撤销，必须把它们推到流程末端，或在执行前记录幂等键，让补偿退化为&quot;标记为需人工介入&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动中间件-cloudevents-outbox-与投递语义\">事件驱动中间件：CloudEvents、Outbox 与投递语义</h2><p>协同模式与编排的异步分支都依赖事件。跨厂商可组合集成里，<strong>互操作性</strong>是第一个坑：commercetools 发出的事件、你自己的 OMS 发出的事件、Kafka 里流动的消息，若字段名各不相同，订阅方就得为每个来源写一份适配。CloudEvents（CNCF 孵化项目，spec v1.0，cloudevents.io）为此定义了一组统一信封字段——<code>id</code>、<code>source</code>、<code>specversion</code>、<code>type</code>、<code>time</code>——让订阅方只按 <code>type</code> 路由、按 <code>id</code> 去重，而不必理解每个发布者的私有结构。</p>\n<p>第二个坑更隐蔽：<strong>写数据库和发事件不是原子的</strong>。先提交订单再发事件，中间崩溃会导致订单存在而事件丢失；先发事件再提交，下游可能消费到一个最终回滚的订单。事务性 Outbox 模式（microservices.io，Chris Richardson）给出标准解法：在同一个本地事务里把&quot;要发的事件&quot;写进业务库的 <code>outbox</code> 表，再由中继进程读表并投递。中继可用轮询，也可用 CDC——Debezium（debezium.io）读数据库 binlog 把 outbox 行转成事件流，避免轮询延迟。</p>\n<p>在 Kafka 一侧，投递语义由生产者配置决定。开启幂等生产者（<code>enable.idempotence=true</code>，KIP-98 引入）后，broker 按 <code>(PID, 分区, 序列号)</code> 去重，解决了重试导致的重复写入；跨分区原子性则要启用 Kafka 事务并配合 <code>read_committed</code> 消费者隔离级别，才构成 Kafka 所称的 exactly-once 语义。但要清楚这是<strong>流处理内部</strong>的精确一次，一旦事件经 HTTP 打到外部支付网关，端到端仍然只能靠消费端幂等实现。因此反直觉的工程结论是：<strong>默认设计成至少一次 + 消费端幂等</strong>，而非追求中间件层面的精确一次——后者在多厂商、多协议的可组合环境里无法端到端维持。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>投递语义</th>\n<th>生产者行为</th>\n<th>消费端必须做的事</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>至多一次 at-most-once</td>\n<td>不重试，可能丢</td>\n<td>无（可丢的埋点、指标）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>至少一次 at-least-once</td>\n<td>失败重试，可能重复</td>\n<td>幂等消费（按事件 <code>id</code> 去重）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确一次 exactly-once</td>\n<td>幂等生产者 + 事务</td>\n<td>仅在流处理内部成立</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"跨服务失败隔离-超时预算-重试放大与舱壁\">跨服务失败隔离：超时预算、重试放大与舱壁</h2><p>可组合架构中最昂贵的故障不是某个服务挂了，而是<strong>一个慢服务拖垮整条链路</strong>。三种机制按层次递进。</p>\n<p>**超时预算（deadline propagation）**是基础。gRPC 的 deadline 语义会把剩余时间随调用链向下传递（grpc.io）：前台 API 给自己 800ms，调 BFF 传 700ms，下游聚合传 500ms。没有预算传递，下游会按自己的默认超时（常见 30s）继续工作，而上游早已放弃，形成&quot;计算了但没人要&quot;的浪费与线程堆积。Google SRE 手册将这类级联失败列为核心议题——一个后端的高延迟会通过共享线程池与连接池迅速传染到所有依赖它的路径。</p>\n<p><strong>重试放大（retry amplification）<strong>是第二个陷阱。若调用链深度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、每层失败重试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 次，最坏情况下底层服务收到的请求量放大为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>amp</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{amp}} = (1 + r)^{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">amp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：三层、每层重试 2 次，放大就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^3 = 27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。这正是&quot;重试把一个抖动变成一次雪崩&quot;的算术。防御有两条：一是重试配合指数退避与抖动，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的等待为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k = \\min\\left(t_{\\max},\\ t_0 \\cdot b^k\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，AWS 架构博客 <em>Exponential Backoff And Jitter</em>（Marc Brooker）指出 full jitter（在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, t_k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上均匀取随机）实践表现最好，因为它把重试请求在时间轴上彻底打散；二是</strong>只在链路中的一层重试</strong>，通常是面向用户的边缘层。</p>\n<p>**舱壁（bulkhead）与熔断（circuit breaker）**是第三层。舱壁用独立线程池或连接池把不同下游隔开，让税务服务变慢不占用支付服务的配额；熔断器则在失败率越阈值时直接拒绝请求、快速失败，给下游恢复窗口。Resilience4j 的默认参数是滑动窗口 100 次调用、失败率阈值 50%、打开状态等待 60s（resilience4j.readme.io）；Netflix Hystrix 作为该模式的开创实现已于 2018 年进入维护模式，新项目普遍转向 Resilience4j 或服务网格侧的熔断。这些阈值必须基于实测。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等键</strong>是让重试变得安全的最后一环。Stripe 通过请求头 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 去重，相同键重复提交返回首次结果、保留 24 小时（stripe.com/docs/api/idempotent_requests）。可组合环境里，幂等键应由编排器生成一次、随每次调用与每次重试透传，这样即使补偿与重试交错，支付也不会被扣两次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败隔离的落地-下单编排的补偿顺序\">失败隔离的落地：下单编排的补偿顺序</h2><p>把上述机制串起来，看一条真实的跨境下单 Saga。正向步骤与补偿动作必须成对定义，补偿严格<strong>逆序</strong>执行，且每一步的副作用都要可幂等重放。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[创建购物车快照] --&gt; B[预留库存]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算税费&lt;br/&gt;Avalara]&#10;    C --&gt; D[授权支付&lt;br/&gt;Adyen]&#10;    D --&gt; E[创建订单记录]&#10;    E --&gt; F[发出订单已创建事件]&#10;    F --&gt; G[触发履约与通知]&#10;    D -.-&gt;|失败| C2[补偿: 释放库存]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|失败| C2&#10;    C2 -.-&gt;|失败| C1[补偿: 标记购物车为废弃]&#10;    E -.-&gt;|失败| C3[补偿: 取消支付授权]&#10;    C3 -.-&gt; C2\">graph TD\n    A[创建购物车快照] --&gt; B[预留库存]\n    B --&gt; C[计算税费&lt;br/&gt;Avalara]\n    C --&gt; D[授权支付&lt;br/&gt;Adyen]\n    D --&gt; E[创建订单记录]\n    E --&gt; F[发出订单已创建事件]\n    F --&gt; G[触发履约与通知]\n    D -.-&gt;|失败| C2[补偿: 释放库存]\n    C -.-&gt;|失败| C2\n    C2 -.-&gt;|失败| C1[补偿: 标记购物车为废弃]\n    E -.-&gt;|失败| C3[补偿: 取消支付授权]\n    C3 -.-&gt; C2</pre><p>设计要点有三。第一，<strong>不可逆动作要后置</strong>：支付授权可以在超时窗口内 void，但一旦捕获（capture）就退化为退款，因此捕获应推到订单确认之后。第二，<strong>补偿必须幂等</strong>，因为补偿本身也可能超时重试，重复的&quot;释放库存&quot;不能再多释放一次，这依赖预留操作携带的唯一 ID。第三，<strong>超时状态要显式建模，不能当作失败</strong>：支付网关超时不等于支付失败，此时既不能直接补偿（可能已扣款），也不能直接成功（可能未扣款），标准做法是把订单置为&quot;待确认&quot;中间态，由对账任务在 T+1 与支付网关逐笔核对后收敛。把超时误判为失败并立即补偿，是跨境支付重复扣款投诉最常见的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>编排与协同的取舍标准是<strong>流程知识的归属</strong>：有明确顺序和补偿需求的流程用编排，广播式通知与多消费者扩展用协同；两者常并存——外层编排、内层事件扇出。</li>\n<li>可组合架构的固有代价是可用性串联衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∏</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\prod A_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，全部隔离与补偿手段都是在攻击这条乘法链条。</li>\n<li>编排载体三选一：托管状态机（Step Functions）、BPMN 引擎（Camunda/Zeebe）、代码优先的持久执行（Temporal）；三者底层都是 1987 年的 Saga 语义，<strong>补偿不等于回滚</strong>。</li>\n<li>事件互操作用 CloudEvents 统一信封；&quot;写库与发事件&quot;的原子性用事务性 Outbox + Debezium CDC 解决；投递语义默认设计成<strong>至少一次 + 消费端幂等</strong>。</li>\n<li>失败隔离三件套：deadline 预算传递防级联、单层重试 + full jitter 防 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1+r)^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 放大、舱壁与熔断防资源挤占。</li>\n<li>超时是独立状态而非失败状态，必须有对账机制收敛，否则直接补偿会制造重复扣款。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本章其余文档（<code>./INDEX.md</code>）继续展开可组合架构的其余模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可组合编排与集成模式：编排 vs 协同、事件驱动中间件与跨服务失败隔离","id":"可组合编排与集成模式-编排-vs-协同-事件驱动中间件与跨服务失败隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：控制流归属决定了集成形态","id":"核心概念-控制流归属决定了集成形态"},{"level":2,"text":"编排器的三种实现载体：状态机、BPMN 引擎与持久执行","id":"编排器的三种实现载体-状态机-bpmn-引擎与持久执行"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动中间件：CloudEvents、Outbox 与投递语义","id":"事件驱动中间件-cloudevents-outbox-与投递语义"},{"level":2,"text":"跨服务失败隔离：超时预算、重试放大与舱壁","id":"跨服务失败隔离-超时预算-重试放大与舱壁"},{"level":2,"text":"失败隔离的落地：下单编排的补偿顺序","id":"失败隔离的落地-下单编排的补偿顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商务领域服务拆分与契约边界：限界上下文、能力域划分与单体爬行防范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/headless-composable-commerce-api-platform/composable-architecture-pattern/commerce-domain-service-decomposition"},"next":{"title":"商务 API 能力面模型：catalog/cart/checkout/order/customer 域与 REST、GraphQL、事件的选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/headless-composable-commerce-api-platform/commerce-api-surface-catalog/commerce-api-surface-model"}}